# Supabase CLI scratch state — the linked ref, the pooler URL and the version
# stamps it caches. Per-machine and rewritten on every CLI call, so tracking it
# means a diff every time anyone runs `supabase`. It carries no credentials
# (the pooler URL has no password), which is the only reason committing it was
# untidy rather than a leak.
supabase/.temp/
